    "turn_text": "Welcome to full disclosure with the Better Government Association. Every Wednesday morning, we check in with David Greising, President and CEO of the BGA to talk about government, how open and transparent it is or isn't and how that's impacting you, David Greising, as always. Thanks for your time and welcome back to the program.",
