  {
    "episode_id": 71227,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/1/71227.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 2,
    "turn_text": "Well, David, hoping that you can give us a little bit more insight into where we stand on two of the big lingering issues this summer, left in limbo the last time we talked, the green energy bill. And also, although it doesn't directly impact us, it does have ripple effects throughout the state, this proposal for an elected Chicago school board. Are we detecting any movement on either of these issues?",
