        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
        "text": "The green energy bill remains undecided since the last conversation.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "The proposed election of a Chicago school board has indirect statewide impacts.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker wants to know if there has been progress on either issue.",
